0..94 Comment "/// This source checks a pair against a fold whose subject reaches its arm through a constant."
95..98 Comment "///"
99..194 Comment "/// It pins how the kernel reads a mode switch whose expected type holds a call in a stuck arm."
195..198 Comment "///"
199..512 Comment "/// The checker\'s reduct of `wp(body, post)` keeps the fold\'s call on `arm`\'s value inside an arm that cases on the record\'s first field. The pair\'s second component checks at that arm, and `afterRead` gives it the type the call runs to. The kernel runs the held call by its δ-step and reads the two types alike."
513..516 Comment "///"
